This repository implements a deterministic AI governance runtime.

The following rules MUST NEVER be violated:

1. No implicit allow behavior.
2. Deny must dominate within the same priority tier.
3. Resolution must be deterministic and order-independent.
4. No policy decision may depend on database row order.
5. Fail-closed behavior is mandatory:
   - No matching policy => DENY
   - Policy engine failure => DENY
6. No import-time side effects:
   - No server auto-start
   - No process lifecycle ownership
   - No dotenv mutation on import
7. No new features during hardening phase.
8. Do not modify executeToolBoundary.
9. Do not weaken tenant isolation.
10. All refactors must preserve semantics and pass tests.

This phase focuses on structural clarity and deterministic resolution only.
